    {
      "id": "b2dd5b7e-ef2c-462f-95f7-4fae3443b489",
      "storeId": "947532c1-0582-4e63-9984-318179bcd8a7",
      "clientId": "72f72e12-367e-42d0-8488-4ca7f745c119",
      "externalId": "f5a9d24f-70a9-49da-a40b-f074998bd253",
      "title": "Phoenix Rising PRINT",
      "description": "<p>Sizes: A3 and A2</p><p>Paper: Premium Matte paper</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Phoenix Rising artist description:</p><p>Phoenix Rising was originally painted large scale with oil paints, so this canvas print is almost an exact copy of the painting. It represents how we can rise from the ashes against all odds. In the face of the hardships that life throws at us, including grief and heartbreak. It is a painting of hope and love.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Features:</p><p>Paper is heavier-weight, white, premium matte paper has a natural, smooth uncoated luxurious finish. The 200 gsm/ 80 lb paper weight makes it durable and long-lasting. We use FSC-certified paper or equivalent certifications depending on regional availability, which is better for the planet.Each poster is shipped in robust packaging, ensuring it arrives safe and secure. Paper sizes may vary slightly by region. For the US and Canada, the measurement is in inches, while for the rest of the world, it is in centimeters. It is printed and shipped on demand. No minimums are required.</p>",
